            <div xml:id="d743">

                <pb facs="0967" n="853" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg853"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861a.01/288</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Chargé</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Saburi</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <p>The Japanese Chargé d’Affaires presents his compliments to the Honorable the
                    Secretary of State and, acting under instructions from the Japanese Government,
                    has the honor to inform him that on the 24th of June the following announcement
                    was made public in Tokio: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Japanese Government have decided to withdraw all the Japanese troops
                            from the Maritime Province of Siberia by the end of October 1922.
                            Suitable measures will be taken for the protection of resident Japanese
                            subjects.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1922-06-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 24, 1922</hi>
                        </date>, <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
